{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_shieldbearer","model_identifier":"dwarf_shieldbearer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_shieldbearer\n\nDwarf shieldbearer (A4), heavy infantry, 1.3 m = 46 u (crest to 50).\n\nDwarf in full heavy armour: riveted steel breastplate with brass trim, mail sleeves and skirt, big riveted pauldrons, plate tassets, steel greaves and gauntlets, a brass-crested helmet with a nasal (the braided beard hangs below). Large rectangular deep-red shield, nearly as tall as the dwarf, with iron bands, brass studs, boss and emblem, worn on the left forearm; one-handed bearded axe. Slow.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -15.0..15.0, y 0.0..48.8, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 50 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- shield_wall: add a 24 x 40 x 3 shield box at z = -12 (blocks arrows)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shield_wall` | 2 | loop | braced crouch behind the shield (hold/loop); the shield face is square to -Z |\n| `axe_chop` | 0.9 | once | key 0.42 s: axe bites over the shield rim (one target) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | shield hanging at the left side, axe in hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | shield arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 0.85 s (slow, heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 78.2 u/s (2.20 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `axe_chop`: key 0.42 s: axe bites over the shield rim (one target)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `tower_shield` (visible, under slot_shield_l): 38 x 22 u board, face -X with the arm hanging\n- `axe` (visible, under slot_hand_r): one-handed bearded axe, 25 u, blade down (-Y)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_grey.png`: grey beard\n"},"description":"# dwarf_shieldbearer\n\nDwarf shieldbearer (A4), heavy infantry, 1.3 m = 46 u (crest to 50).\n\nDwarf in full heavy armour: riveted steel breastplate with brass trim, mail sleeves and skirt, big riveted pauldrons, plate tassets, steel greaves and gauntlets, a brass-crested helmet with a nasal (the braided beard hangs below). Large rectangular deep-red shield, nearly as tall as the dwarf, with iron bands, brass studs, boss and emblem, worn on the left forearm; one-handed bearded axe. Slow.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -15.0..15.0, y 0.0..48.8, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 50 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- shield_wall: add a 24 x 40 x 3 shield box at z = -12 (blocks arrows)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shield_wall` | 2 | loop | braced crouch behind the shield (hold/loop); the shield face is square to -Z |\n| `axe_chop` | 0.9 | once | key 0.42 s: axe bites over the shield rim (one target) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | shield hanging at the left side, axe in hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | shield arm thrown up |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 0.85 s (slow, heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 78.2 u/s (2.20 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `axe_chop`: key 0.42 s: axe bites over the shield rim (one target)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `tower_shield` (visible, under slot_shield_l): 38 x 22 u board, face -X with the arm hanging\n- `axe` (visible, under slot_hand_r): one-handed bearded axe, 25 u, blade down (-Y)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_shieldbearer_grey.png`: grey beard\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,21.0,-4.5],"to":[7.0,24.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22,85,36.0,88.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50,85,59.0,88.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[36,85,50.0,88.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[59,85,68.0,88.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[64,38,78.0,47.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[78,38,92.0,47.0